<v Dale Sekovich>Mark Erickson is a real person. He was named in our lawsuit.
<v Dale Sekovich>马克·埃里克森是真人。他在我们的诉讼中被点名了。

00:24:59.010 --> 00:25:02.310
<v Nancy  Updike>And was he an original producer of Hard Copy?
<v Nancy  Updike>他是《硬拷贝》的原制片人吗？

00:25:02.310 --> 00:25:10.400
<v Dale Sekovich>No. He was a segment producer and on the air reporter for Hard Copy for a brief period of time.
