00:25:10.400 --> 00:25:28.050
<v Nancy Updike>And is this sort of typical of the cons in the tapes that you've heard, that they'll try to associate what they're selling with a legitimate business or organization or television show, something that people have heard of.
<v Nancy Updike>这是否是你在录音中听到的那种骗局的典型手法，即他们会试图将他们销售的东西与合法的企业、组织或电视节目联系起来，也就是人们听说过的东西。

